  "objective": "Correct direct-proportionality misconception using equation transformation, water-pipe hydraulic analogy, and descending I-vs-R curve",
  "narration": "Socho ek water pipe mein paani beh raha hai. Agar pipe ko narrow kar do (matlab resistance badhao), toh paani ka flow (matlab current) KAM hoga, zyada nahi! Isi tarah formula I = V/R mein, jab Resistance R denominator mein badhta hai, toh Current I ghat'ta hai.",
